# In the Mood for Love (jeuno 69): the available check's CoP edge. A level 75 Warrior, CoP A Vessel Without a Captain
# current (318, not past it), a Chameleon Diamond: Odasel's default 162; The Road Forks (325; a GM, A Vessel Without a
# Captain completed first: addMission refuses to overwrite a current mission): the diamond traded while the quest is
# only available: no onTrade: nothing (the diamond kept); 10035, begun.
lists LowerJeuno/Odasel/onTrigger LowerJeuno/Odasel/onTrade LowerJeuno/onEventFinish/10035
char zone=LowerJeuno pos=-56.9,-6,-111.7 job=WAR lvl=75
mission Cop AVesselWithoutACaptain current
item ChameleonDiamond
login
trigger Odasel                          # 318: no section; 162
finish
mission Cop AVesselWithoutACaptain completed # a GM: the log's current mission cleared
mission Cop TheRoadForks current        # a GM
trade Odasel ChameleonDiamond x1  # available: no onTrade: nothing
trigger Odasel                          # 10035
finish                                  # begun
